    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida haw ea ghweelmeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, dooshta mida doodooda, mida meatkweeda ghayeawa gajeajap eawooji lah bea gadiyeeda nea eaweeda sabaato gajeajaat, nea eara eaweeda sing'ushiina sheeda gajeajaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida haw gayghwahidu gah nea gwasku doodoodeaba dooshtida duukusa jaroodean. Ak gayghamiinaada aba murdeeda huwanga gidaghuuta, nea abeeda ashoohoodiga ghoadayda haleanjeadaanyi sisabwa geadi sighwarda, ea gea sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo, ak gayghabwat ASEETA aba gidingeanda gidaghuuta. Ama ng'ata gwarita gawa ak dooshtida ea mwajeajap ea ghoah shing'ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga bea ng'eanyiida gayghabwat ASEETA aba ghuuta dooshta aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA eaweeda sabaato ea eaweeda ng'ushiinda sheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sighwarda jea ghoadaw siida haw NG'UTAMIIDA eaweeda sabaato abeeda gajea gisil lah gil manda sirjeeda ea lagweenda manda sirjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was dearanga gajea giihearmoanagi gil aba lagweenjeanjagi ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was dearanga aba dayeegiga bea gisilgean aba gidammu ghoadayda, ea bayoagagi bea nagheeda aba giihearmoanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweeda ng'ushiinda sheeda, abeeda gajea jurukuta mwanang' manda sirjeeda gil, ea dayi lah bea gisilga ea lagweenda ak ea maygwanda sirjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak niny gaygwasin haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was dearanga, giihearmoanagi aba jurukuta, ea giihearmoanagi aba lagweenda ea dayeegiga bea gisilgean, ea gida ammu ghoadayda, ea bayoagagi bea nagheeda aba giihearmoanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyas ghwahidu siida haw gah gayghwahidu nea gwasku naweeda doodoodeaba dooshtida, ak gaygwarita nea gabiikteawa naweedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama inyas ghapka fuga ng'eanyiida madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda ghweelmeeda sirugu, nea dea hidu ghabwat ASEETA nea gwasku naweeda dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, abeeda gaygwarita nea gwasik dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara. Nea dea hidu nea gwasku dooshta bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, abeeda gaygwarita nea gwasik naweeda dooshta bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. Nea maygabiikta gwasik dooshta gwachi sigu, ak gaygwarita gawa mwadi nea ghoadoabiiw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyas ghwahidu siida haw abeeda gaygawa bugusta nyaawa. Ama saawa inyas gwarita gaygwarita sean nea goodeayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba damanda ghweelmeeda ea ghweelmoojiga suurja sirugu, abeeda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda dearanga gajea giihearmoanagi gil aba jurukuta mwanang' ea giihearmoanagi aba lagweenjeanjagi, nea aba dayeegiga bea gisilgean gayghoadayda gida ammu, nea bayoagagi bea nagheeda aba giihearmoanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida haw iigasa ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda adayda niny aba gidagasiida, was haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sighwarda ghana haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo. Was haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi adaw NG'UTAMIIDA aba gida gasiida niny nea gabwa geaw. Abeeda gajeajaat dooshtida mida meatkweeda ghayeawaan, abeeda gayghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sighwarda ea gea hoyyoo gawuurji gidahiniida eaweeda sabaato. Ama ng'ata gaygwarita, ama rita gajeajap dooshta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda bea galeaga sean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyeesa gilinyoo ea sakteayda gil gajoatawa NG'UTAMIIDA dayeenda gisilleanda bea gwanyagi manda sirjeeda ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gilinyoo ea sakteayda gil gajeatayda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi was dearanga. Gilagi aba jeeda gea as lah bea giihearmoanagi ea gilagi aba jeeda gea as samwagu bea bayoagagi bea nagheeda. Ak gajeekuuyi dearangiga miyaasiin was haleanjeeda sisapa geadi galeaga sean was dearanga bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak nih ea deaweeda gil jea eesina damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo ea sakteayda gil gajeataw Ng'utamiida dayeenda gisilleanda, ea dearanga, ea nagheeda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea galeaga sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida haw ea ng'eanyiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA inyas ghoadaw siida haw orjoagaaschi wassean haleanjeeda guskuseega jea gwahearan, abeeda gayghoah dea orjoagaaschi, jea gwahearan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyadaw siyagi bea gadiyeadaanyi haleanjeeda mwaatkwa bea hearaniischoadaanyi, abeeda gayghoah daanyi ea ghwahita gweayda jea goombal geaw. Abeeda gaygabiiksa heeda siida haw, nea hearaniischoadaanyi nih gayghoah dea orjoagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida haw ea maygageandeawa buuneeda hearaniischooda nyaawa. Nea maygooruuteawa buuneeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa aba uurda, gayghoadaw orjoagaaschi hearaniischooda aba jeeda haleanjeadaanyi, adiidu ghwadarda fugeasu nea gwasheagiida hearaniischoadaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghoorajeega siiwoosacheewa bea gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean siidida nea goosiiknean naweeda siska iisuweay jeeda ghoorajeega ghaydidi bea ashoohoodiga duukusa meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, bea murdeeda dooshta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea doodooda mida gah. Ak ghoahiimnaan heeda meatkweeda biyeara bea ghoorajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean, “Nih heeda awoola ashoohoodiga banyeega haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea giidiinyeanda, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba riing'eeda, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was dearanga. Ak ea meeruuta gil jarooda bea doodooda ak ea mang'udana buuneeda ririnnyeanda iisat gidaghaydit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweanean gicha ea ghoahiinaan doodooda duukusa jarooda, ak goosiigan murdeeda gujakiga asang'wan bea doodoodean nea gilinyoo ea meadajeegiga asang'waniin gil bea doodoodean gwanda doodooda mwanang'– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
